  "outcome": "completed",
  "summary": "Amended design plan after an independent review; execution is not authorized. Adds explicit dispatch semantics: separate node and tag maps; priority-ordered claim/decline/refuse; equal-priority, reserved-name and kind-mismatch compile errors; cumulative mark composition; one encoder per type or mark; merging only equal containers. Adds a runtime-owned attribute wire codec keyed by schema property kind, with escaping, defaults, required and unknown/malformed rules. Restates the contract: the built-in grammar is total and source-dependent failures become diagnostics, while configured remark plugins and invariant failures may throw. Adds hostile-literal writer proof (8/11 round trip; a newline in an attribute and numeric- or JSON-looking strings fail, routed to the codec and D5). Names the detached parseMarkdownSlice/parseMarkdownInline exports as the cut while the editor methods stay. Corrects the AI table risk to parsing each returned content value. Orders S6 before S5. Trims the evidence folder to runners, logs and notes.",
